"২৮) যদি 64<sup>2/3</sup> + 625<sup>1/2</sup> = 3k হয়, তবে k এর মান-", "option1": "ক) 25/4", "option2": "খ) 34/3", "option3": "গ) 41/3", "option4": "ঘ) 62/5", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>64<sup>2/3</sup> + 625<sup>1/2</sup> = 3k <br>=&gt; (4<sup>3</sup>)<sup>2/3&nbsp;</sup>+ (25<sup>2</sup>)<sup>1/2</sup> = 3k <br>=&gt; 4<sup>2</sup> + 25 = 3k <br>=&gt; 41 = 3k <br>=&gt; k = 41/3</p>"}, {"id": "29", "question": "২৯) 1+5+9.............+ 81 = কত?", "option1": "ক) 481", "option2": "খ) 641", "option3": "গ) 461", "option4": "ঘ) None", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>&nbsp;সমষ্টি = গড় x পদ সংখ্যা<br>= (81+1)/2 &times; {( 81-1)/4} +1<br>= 82/2 &times;80/4 +1<br>= 41 x 21 <br>= 861</p>"}, {"id": "30", "question": "৩০) কোনাে সমান্তর ধারার ১ম পদ ২২ এবং ২য় পদ ২৭ হলে ১৫তম পদ কত?", "option1": "ক) ৯২", "option2": "খ) ৭২", "option3": "গ) ৬২", "option4": "ঘ) ৮২", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>&nbsp;১ম পদ a = ২২<br>২য় পদ ২৭<br>সাধারণ অন্তর d = ২৭- ২২ =৫<br>১৫তম পদ = a + (১৫ -১) d<br>= ২২ + (১৪&times;৫)<br>= ২২ + ৭০<br>= ৯২</p>"}]}, "exam_time": 1800000, "pk": 1641, "is_omr": false, "omr_time": 7200000, "is_mapping": false, "question_mapping": {}, "_source": "exam-view", "_exam_id": 1641}